<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>Eurogamer.net Latest Articles Feed</title><link>https://www.eurogamer.net/feed</link><description>This is a feed of the latest articles from Eurogamer.net.</description><atom:link href="https://www.eurogamer.net/feed" rel="self"/><language>en</language><copyright>Copyright (c) Eurogamer.net a brand of IGN Entertainment, Inc.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:42:20 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>GTA 6 won't let you use cheats until you complete the main story, and locks progression when you do</title><link>https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-no-cheats-until-completing-main-story</link><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Chris Tapsell</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:42:20 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-no-cheats-until-completing-main-story</guid><category>Action Adventure</category><category>First person</category><category>Full product</category><category>Grand Theft Auto 6</category><category>Modern Day</category><category>Multiplayer Competitive</category><category>Multiplayer Cooperative</category><category>Open World</category><category>PS5</category><category>Racing</category><category>Rockstar Games</category><category>Rockstar North</category><category>Shooter</category><category>Shooter: Third Person</category><category>Single Player</category><category>Take-Two Interactive</category><category>Third person</category><category>Xbox Series X/S</category><media:content medium="image" url="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/GTA-6-review-2.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp"/><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/GTA-6-review-2.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp" /> <p>Here's a twist: you can't use cheats in <a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-review">Grand Theft Auto 6</a> until you complete the entire game's main story.</p> <p><a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-no-cheats-until-completing-main-story">Read more</a></p>]]></description></item><item><title>Even the PS5 Pro is "not powerful enough" to run GTA 6 at 60FPS or 40FPS, Rockstar says</title><link>https://www.eurogamer.net/ps5-pro-not-powerful-enough-gta-6-60fps</link><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Kaan Serin</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:17:50 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.eurogamer.net/ps5-pro-not-powerful-enough-gta-6-60fps</guid><category>Action Adventure</category><category>First person</category><category>Full product</category><category>Grand Theft Auto 6</category><category>Modern Day</category><category>Multiplayer Competitive</category><category>Multiplayer Cooperative</category><category>Open World</category><category>PS5</category><category>Racing</category><category>Rockstar Games</category><category>Rockstar North</category><category>Shooter</category><category>Shooter: Third Person</category><category>Single Player</category><category>Take-Two Interactive</category><category>Third person</category><category>Xbox Series X/S</category><media:content medium="image" url="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/gta-6-shirtless-jason-weightlifting.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp"/><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/gta-6-shirtless-jason-weightlifting.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp" /> <p>Don't expect <a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-review">GTA 6</a> to get an update supporting higher framerate modes, at least, not on current-generation consoles. Rockstar has explained that even the most powerful console of the bunch, the <a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/topics/ps5-pro">PS5 Pro</a>, isn't powerful enough to run the lavish game at 40FPS or 60FPS.</p> <p><a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/ps5-pro-not-powerful-enough-gta-6-60fps">Read more</a></p>]]></description></item><item><title>PSA: Some GTA 6 Ultimate Edition content is only available for the first chapter, and you'll have to put in hard graft to unlock more</title><link>https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-ultimate-edition-unlock-details-temporary-content</link><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Matt Wales</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:42:30 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-ultimate-edition-unlock-details-temporary-content</guid><category>Action Adventure</category><category>First person</category><category>Full product</category><category>Grand Theft Auto 6</category><category>Modern Day</category><category>Multiplayer Competitive</category><category>Multiplayer Cooperative</category><category>Open World</category><category>PS5</category><category>Racing</category><category>Rockstar Games</category><category>Rockstar North</category><category>Shooter</category><category>Shooter: Third Person</category><category>Single Player</category><category>Take-Two Interactive</category><category>Third person</category><category>Xbox Series X/S</category><media:content medium="image" url="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/ULTIMATE_EDITION_SAFEHOUSE_VEHICLES_03.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp"/><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/ULTIMATE_EDITION_SAFEHOUSE_VEHICLES_03.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp" /> <p><a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-preorders-gta6-no-disc">GTA 6's Ultimate Edition</a> has proven enormously popular, despite its hefty $100 price tag. So much so that Strauss Zelnick, boss of Rockstar parent company Take-Two, <a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-pre-orders-ultimate-edition-100-dollars">recently confirmed it's the edition most people are buying</a> - and that's despite a lack of specific information about how its unlockable content works. With <a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-review">GTA 6</a> just hours away from release, however - and out now in certain parts of the work - details are beginning to emerge, and the answer is perhaps a little surprising.</p> <p><a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-ultimate-edition-unlock-details-temporary-content">Read more</a></p>]]></description></item><item><title>Most, though not quite all, of the 34 fired Rockstar employees are named in the GTA 6 credits</title><link>https://www.eurogamer.net/fired-rockstar-employees-named-gta-6-credits-tribunal</link><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Robert Purchese</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:35:50 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.eurogamer.net/fired-rockstar-employees-named-gta-6-credits-tribunal</guid><category>Action Adventure</category><category>First person</category><category>Full product</category><category>Grand Theft Auto 6</category><category>Modern Day</category><category>Multiplayer Competitive</category><category>Multiplayer Cooperative</category><category>Open World</category><category>PS5</category><category>Racing</category><category>Rockstar Games</category><category>Rockstar North</category><category>Shooter</category><category>Shooter: Third Person</category><category>Single Player</category><category>Take-Two Interactive</category><category>Third person</category><category>Xbox Series X/S</category><media:content medium="image" url="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/brian-gta-6.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp"/><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/brian-gta-6.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp" /> <p>Eurogamer can confirm that at least 28 of the 34 employees fired by Rockstar roughly a year ago - in an action that directly led to <a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/rockstar-gta-6-fired-employees-tribunal-statements">the employment tribunal Rockstar is currently facing in Scotland</a> - are named in the credits of <a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-review">Grand Theft Auto 6</a>.</p> <p><a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/fired-rockstar-employees-named-gta-6-credits-tribunal">Read more</a></p>]]></description></item><item><title>GTA 6 is so big, it managed to break Reddit - and it isn't even actually out yet</title><link>https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-breaks-reddit-not-out-yet</link><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Connor Makar</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:07:50 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-breaks-reddit-not-out-yet</guid><category>Action Adventure</category><category>First person</category><category>Full product</category><category>Grand Theft Auto 6</category><category>Modern Day</category><category>Multiplayer Competitive</category><category>Multiplayer Cooperative</category><category>Open World</category><category>PS5</category><category>Racing</category><category>Rockstar Games</category><category>Rockstar North</category><category>Shooter</category><category>Shooter: Third Person</category><category>Single Player</category><category>Take-Two Interactive</category><category>Third person</category><category>Xbox Series X/S</category><media:content medium="image" url="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/reddit-gta-6.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp"/><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/reddit-gta-6.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp" /> <p><a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-review">Grand Theft Auto 6</a> isn't even out yet, and it's already causing some technical issues over at the game's official Reddit page.</p> <p><a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-breaks-reddit-not-out-yet">Read more</a></p>]]></description></item><item><title>GTA 6 breaks the all-time livestream viewer record hours before it's  available to play for most of the world</title><link>https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-streaming-record-broken</link><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Connor Makar</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:42:50 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-streaming-record-broken</guid><category>Action Adventure</category><category>First person</category><category>Full product</category><category>Grand Theft Auto 6</category><category>Modern Day</category><category>Multiplayer Competitive</category><category>Multiplayer Cooperative</category><category>Open World</category><category>PS5</category><category>Racing</category><category>Rockstar Games</category><category>Rockstar North</category><category>Shooter</category><category>Shooter: Third Person</category><category>Single Player</category><category>Take-Two Interactive</category><category>Third person</category><category>Xbox Series X/S</category><media:content medium="image" url="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/grand-theft-auto-6-man-holding-phone-near-lucia.png?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp"/><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/grand-theft-auto-6-man-holding-phone-near-lucia.png?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp" /> <p>Hours before it's even playable in most of the world, <a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-review">Grand Theft Auto 6</a> has already broken the record for the most viewers across livestreaming platforms like <a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/companies/twitch">Twitch</a>.</p> <p><a href="https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-streaming-record-broken">Read more</a></p>]]></description></item>
